# The ONE place the Ubuntu Touch identity lives (CMakeLists.txt, scripts/check-click.py and
# the CI lane read it; nothing else hardcodes it).
#
# OWNER FOLLOW-UP (plan rule R11 / OQ-25): the click name must have a NAMES.md row, and
# NAMES.md lives outside this repo. `nooz.asoc` is PROVISIONAL, chosen to follow the
# owner's `com.asoc.<appname>` Apple ruling (2026-11-17) in click's `<app>.<developer>`
# shape; change it here, in this file only.
#
# No signing material, no store credentials, ever. Click packages are unsigned; the
# OpenStore signs on upload.
CLICK_NAME=nooz.asoc
CLICK_VERSION=0.5.0
# Framework: the OnePlus 6 (the owner's UT device) reads as 20.04-only (plan §8, OQ-37).
# The 24.04 framework name is NOT verified here; bump when a 24.04 device exists.
CLICK_FRAMEWORK=ubuntu-sdk-20.04
CLICK_MAINTAINER=OWNER-FILL <owner@example.invalid>
